WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.280
Il pomeriggio

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.360
rallenta.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.120
Ombre lunghe.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:06.680
Un bicchiere, il silenzio.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.253
e le ombre

00:00:09.253 --> 00:00:11.587
si allungano sul

00:00:11.587 --> 00:00:12.364
pergolato.

00:00:12.364 --> 00:00:13.920
Il bicchiere

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.920
resta

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.720
sul tavolo, il tempo

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.960
The Art of Being
